<section class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">THE BAND'S REACH</p><h2>Approximate locations</h2><p><a class="text-link" href="<?=e(app_url('admin/analytics/geography.php'))?>">Manage location data →</a></p><p class="muted">Country is estimated locally from the network address. VPNs, mobile networks, and proxies can change the result. Region and city appear only when a compatible city database is available.</p><div class="analytics-grid analytics-geo-grid"><div><h3>Countries</h3><?php A::bars($report['countries'],'country','visits','No visits recorded in this period.',(int)$summary['visits']); ?></div><div><h3>Regions</h3><?php $regions=array_map(static fn($r)=>['label'=>(implode(', ',array_unique(array_filter([$r['region'],$r['country']],static fn($v)=>$v!==''&&$v!=='Unknown')))?:'Unknown'),'visits'=>$r['visits']],$report['regions']); A::bars($regions,'label','visits','No region data is available for this period.',(int)$summary['visits']); ?></div><div><h3>Cities</h3><?php $cities=array_map(static fn($r)=>['label'=>(implode(', ',array_unique(array_filter([$r['city'],$r['region'],$r['country']],static fn($v)=>$v!==''&&$v!=='Unknown')))?:'Unknown'),'visits'=>$r['visits']],$report['cities']); A::bars($cities,'label','visits','No city data is available for this period.',(int)$summary['visits']); ?></div></div><p class="small muted">Country database: <?=e($geo['country_available']?($geo['source'].' · '.$geo['country_version']):'Unavailable')?>. City database: <?=e($geo['city_available']?($geo['city_source'].' · '.$geo['city_version']):'Not installed')?>.</p><p class="small"><a href="https://db-ip.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IP Geolocation by DB-IP</a> · Country estimates are approximate. Browser GPS is never requested.</p></section>
<section class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">CAMPAIGNS</p><h2>Links that bring people in</h2><p class="muted small">Recognized UTM source, medium, and campaign tags from entry links.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table class="content-table"><caption class="sr-only">Traffic by campaign tags</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Source</th><th scope="col">Medium</th><th scope="col">Campaign</th><th scope="col">Visits</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php if (!$report['campaigns']): ?><tr><td colspan="4" class="analytics-empty">No campaign tags were recorded for these dates.</td></tr><?php endif; ?><?php foreach ($report['campaigns'] as $campaign): ?><tr><td><?=e($campaign['source']?:'—')?></td><td><?=e($campaign['medium']?:'—')?></td><td><?=e($campaign['campaign']?:'—')?></td><td><?=A::number((int)$campaign['visits'])?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="panel"><div class="section-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">SEARCH SPIDERS &amp; OTHER BOTS</p><h2>Crawler activity</h2></div><span class="pill">Excluded from human visits</span></div><p class="muted">Reported identity comes from the crawler's user agent. A verified label requires a match against the bundled official network ranges; a name alone is not verification.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table class="content-table"><caption class="sr-only">Reported crawler families, verification and request totals</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Crawler</th><th scope="col">Identity check</th><th scope="col">Requests</th><th scope="col">Last seen (UTC)</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php if (!$report['crawlers']): ?><tr><td colspan="4" class="analytics-empty">No crawler requests recorded for this period.</td></tr><?php endif; ?><?php foreach ($report['crawlers'] as $crawler): ?><tr><td><?=e($crawler['family'])?></td><td><?=e($crawler['verification']==='verified_range'?'Verified network':'Reported identity')?></td><td><?=A::number((int)$crawler['hits'])?></td><td><?=e($crawler['last_seen'])?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></tbody></table></div><p class="small muted">Bots that conceal their identity may still be counted as visits. This report measures requests reaching the application, not traffic stopped by a CDN or firewall.</p></section>
